  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Spinneys</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of a senior secured loan (the &quot;Loan&quot;) of up to USD22,000,000 to  Spinneys Levant Limited (the &quot;Company&quot;), one of the leading modern retail  chains in Lebanon.  The Loan will allow the Company to implement its expansion plan. In particular,  the Loan will assist the Company to (i) invest in a new processing production  line for fresh food related items; (ii) invest in new stores; and (iii) upgrade  existing equipment to increase the energy efficiency of the operations.</narrative>
  </description>
